prefix[i] = nums[0] + nums[1] + ... + nums[i]


Example

Suppose we want:

nums[1..3]

That's:

4 + 1 + 5 = 10

Using prefix:

prefix[3] - prefix[0]
= 12 - 2
= 10

The general formula is:



sum(left, right)
=
prefix[right + 1] - prefix[left]



prefix[i + 1] = prefix[i] + nums[i];




Build:
prefix[i + 1] = prefix[i] + nums[i]

Query:
prefix[right + 1] - prefix[left]